@startuml lifecycle-transition
title Conditional Lifecycle Transition

participant "Payment Processor" as Processor
database "DynamoDB" as DB

Processor -> DB: strong GetItem(PAYMENT)
DB --> Processor: status=PROCESSING, version=2
Processor -> DB: transaction\ncondition PROCESSING + version 2\nupdate to terminal version 3\nput terminal event

alt this command wins
  DB --> Processor: committed
else condition fails
  DB --> Processor: cancelled
  Processor -> DB: strong GetItem(PAYMENT)
  DB --> Processor: current state/version
  Processor -> Processor: classify duplicate as no-op\nor competing transition as conflict
end
@enduml
